Package: webui
Version: 0.4.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: 0xkee
Depends: keenetic-entware-extras, nginx, nginx-mod-lua, logrotate
Description: Custom dashboard and reverse proxy for Keenetic/Entware.
 Provides a custom web dashboard at port 8080 showing status of
 geo-split, smartdns-conf-ru-split, and smartdns-redirect services.
 Proxies stock Keenetic WebUI with inject.js for sidebar integration.
 Includes logrotate config for nginx-webui log rotation.
Section: net
Priority: optional
